licitação de garantia, você deve fornecer um comprovante de compra com nome do produto, preço, local e data da compra.\",{\"valueRichText\":6590},{\"json\":6591,\"__typename\":3413},{\"data\":6592,\"content\":6593,\"nodeType\":3376},{},[6594,6601,6611,6617,6623,6629,6635,6641,6647,6653],{\"data\":6595,\"content\":6596,\"nodeType\":6193},{},[6597],{\"data\":6598,\"marks\":6599,\"value\":6600,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],\"SÓ PARA QUEM TEM CONTA ON\",{\"data\":6602,\"content\":6603,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6604,6607],{\"data\":6605,\"marks\":6606,\"value\":5363,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6608,\"marks\":6609,\"value\":6610,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],\"Este é só um dos (muitos) benefícios de ter uma conta On. Para comprar este produto, você precisa entrar na sua conta ou criar uma gratuitamente.\",{\"data\":6612,\"content\":6613,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6614],{\"data\":6615,\"marks\":6616,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6618,\"content\":6619,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6620],{\"data\":6621,\"marks\":6622,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6624,\"content\":6625,\"nodeType\":6193},{},[6626],{\"data\":6627,\"marks\":6628,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6630,\"content\":6631,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6632],{\"data\":6633,\"marks\":6634,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6636,\"content\":6637,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6638],{\"data\":6639,\"marks\":6640,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6642,\"content\":6643,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6644],{\"data\":6645,\"marks\":6646,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6648,\"content\":6649,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6650],{\"data\":6651,\"marks\":6652,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"data\":6654,\"content\":6655,\"nodeType\":3380},{},[6656],{\"data\":6657,\"marks\":6658,\"value\":1972,\"nodeType\":3384},{},[],{\"valueRichText\":6660},{\"json\":6661,\"__typename\":3413},{\"data\":6662,\"content\":6663,\"nodeType\":3376},{},[6664,6670,6680,6686,6692,6698,6